[
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 107.95,
    "end": 116.78,
    "transcript": "night sleeping again, babe? Yeah, I just can't shake this feeling I've been having like me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 119.32,
    "end": 143.73,
    "transcript": "I feel like I'm losing my mind. Do you want to see someone? Take a shower and get ready"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 143.73,
    "end": 258.6,
    "transcript": "for bed. Okay. Food is ready. Coffee's almost done. Thanks, babe. I'll need it. How are"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 258.6,
    "end": 264.34,
    "transcript": "you feeling? I thought I heard you fall in the bathroom. Oh, I thought I saw something"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 264.34,
    "end": 274.88,
    "transcript": "that I didn't. Like I've slept it all. But with a little coffee, good meal, with my beautiful"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 274.88,
    "end": 281.16,
    "transcript": "wife, I'll be just fine. Well, babe, I made you just the way you like it. Slightly burnt?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 284.31,
    "end": 296.58,
    "transcript": "Hey, I'm worried about you, babe. I know, but I promise I'll see someone if it gets"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 296.58,
    "end": 300.58,
    "transcript": "worse. Okay. Okay. Well, you have a girlfriend."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 300.62,
    "end": 307.12,
    "transcript": "Great day at work? Mm-hmm. I'm going to jump in the shower. See you tonight. Tonight?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 308.14,
    "end": 318.48,
    "transcript": "Bill, don't tell me you forgot about tonight. No. I remember. I was just messing with you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 319.02,
    "end": 330.43,
    "transcript": "Yeah, okay. So I'll see you at the hotel at around 8? Because it's our three-year anniversary"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 330.43,
    "end": 334.61,
    "transcript": "and I love you. That's what I thought."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 338.12,
    "end": 339.04,
    "transcript": "Love you, honey."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 339.6,
    "end": 340.3,
    "transcript": "Yeah, you do."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 358.74,
    "end": 360.84,
    "transcript": "Hi, Jeff. What's up?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 361.06,
    "end": 362.78,
    "transcript": "Hey, man. Are you still on board tonight?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 364.26,
    "end": 368.88,
    "transcript": "No, I'm sorry. I forgot it's our wedding anniversary tonight."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 368.88,
    "end": 369.14,
    "transcript": "All right."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 371.66,
    "end": 374.44,
    "transcript": "Okay, then. Tomorrow at 9, then you owe me a beer at the pub."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 375.16,
    "end": 375.88,
    "transcript": "Fair enough."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 377.26,
    "end": 380.1,
    "transcript": "And there is some stuff I want to unpack, yeah."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 380.72,
    "end": 381.42,
    "transcript": "About what?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 382.74,
    "end": 386.1,
    "transcript": "Nothing big. I just want to talk to you about some opportunities that have come up."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 386.76,
    "end": 389.0,
    "transcript": "To be honest, I want some beer at your first."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 389.02,
    "end": 391.02,
    "transcript": "I'm sure of it. See you at our..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 391.02,
    "end": 394.8,
    "transcript": "You? You there?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 395.38,
    "end": 398.16,
    "transcript": "Oh, yeah. I'm sorry. I lost my thought for a minute."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 399.36,
    "end": 400.48,
    "transcript": "Is there anything on your mind?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 402.53,
    "end": 405.63,
    "transcript": "No. Just work stuff."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 406.17,
    "end": 411.36,
    "transcript": "You say so. Hey, it'll all work out for you. It always does."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 412.46,
    "end": 413.18,
    "transcript": "Hope so."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 414.08,
    "end": 415.3,
    "transcript": "So, tomorrow then?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 416.8,
    "end": 419.12,
    "transcript": "Yeah. Nine o'clock."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 419.74,
    "end": 421.72,
    "transcript": "Tomorrow, yeah. See you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 422.18,
    "end": 423.8,
    "transcript": "Okay. Sounds good. I'll talk to you then."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 424.48,
    "end": 424.78,
    "transcript": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 434.76,
    "end": 435.8,
    "transcript": "What the hell's going on?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 626.55,
    "end": 630.35,
    "transcript": "Jeff. She's dead. She's dead."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 632.85,
    "end": 633.91,
    "transcript": "Emily, for Christ's sake!"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 634.97,
    "end": 638.71,
    "transcript": "I don't know how I got here, or if I killed her. She's dead."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 735.42,
    "end": 737.62,
    "transcript": "Of course I am. What's wrong with you?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 739.79,
    "end": 742.09,
    "transcript": "What about the hotel? Our night last night?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 742.09,
    "end": 746.81,
    "transcript": "I called you and told you our reservations were cancelled. We never got to go."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 746.83,
    "end": 746.87,
    "transcript": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 747.67,
    "end": 748.53,
    "transcript": "Are you joking?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 748.55,
    "end": 750.79,
    "transcript": "You mean, we never went last night?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 751.25,
    "end": 752.11,
    "transcript": "No, we didn't go."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 752.27,
    "end": 752.95,
    "transcript": "Was that a dream?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 753.51,
    "end": 757.99,
    "transcript": "When I got home, you were already asleep. I knew how much you needed to rest, so I just left you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 767.08,
    "end": 775.59,
    "transcript": "Hey, did I call you last night?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 775.83,
    "end": 780.45,
    "transcript": "What? No. Emily did. She's..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 780.45,
    "end": 783.35,
    "transcript": "Must have been a dream then. See you tonight."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 783.51,
    "end": 783.71,
    "transcript": "Whoa."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 789.13,
    "end": 793.45,
    "transcript": "I called and made you an appointment with the doctor. You need to talk to someone."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 794.17,
    "end": 797.49,
    "transcript": "Okay. You're right. I do."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 797.65,
    "end": 797.89,
    "transcript": "Really?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 799.31,
    "end": 799.59,
    "transcript": "I..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 799.59,
    "end": 799.81,
    "transcript": "Really?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 800.61,
    "end": 800.79,
    "transcript": "Yeah."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 800.79,
    "end": 801.29,
    "transcript": "I didn't think..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 801.29,
    "end": 801.81,
    "transcript": "I don't think you would."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 803.29,
    "end": 804.81,
    "transcript": "You must really be losing your mind."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 807.32,
    "end": 807.88,
    "transcript": "I don't think so."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 808.22,
    "end": 814.26,
    "transcript": "This means a lot to me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 818.01,
    "end": 820.55,
    "transcript": "I mean, it's at noon. I already called you in sick."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 821.61,
    "end": 822.71,
    "transcript": "Yeah, it was on the fridge."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 825.23,
    "end": 826.59,
    "transcript": "Your coffee and paper are right here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 935.88,
    "end": 936.7,
    "transcript": "How did I get here?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 937.1,
    "end": 939.74,
    "transcript": "I assume you drove."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 940.16,
    "end": 942.84,
    "transcript": "I don't remember how I got here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 947.36,
    "end": 951.46,
    "transcript": "You came in. We were talking about how your wife made the appointment."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 952.88,
    "end": 956.4,
    "transcript": "You were telling me about when you were young."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 958.06,
    "end": 958.86,
    "transcript": "Growing up."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 959.16,
    "end": 964.98,
    "transcript": "How you felt when your parents died and you came here to live with your aunt when you were nine."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 966.56,
    "end": 974.02,
    "transcript": "How your whole life you've been the good guy, but it's never paid off for you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 974.48,
    "end": 975.72,
    "transcript": "You don't remember any of that?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 976.02,
    "end": 982.38,
    "transcript": "This isn't funny."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 983.78,
    "end": 985.86,
    "transcript": "Look, I'm not joking."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 990.63,
    "end": 992.19,
    "transcript": "Was I saying anything else?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 992.59,
    "end": 998.21,
    "transcript": "Well, just before you were telling me you made a decision."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 998.57,
    "end": 1015.53,
    "transcript": "You don't think you can forgive yourself for it to settle your mind?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1040.21,
    "end": 1046.63,
    "transcript": "To be honest with you, Doc, I don't know what's real or not right now."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1046.95,
    "end": 1052.38,
    "transcript": "I don't know how long I've been wearing these clothes."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1054.69,
    "end": 1056.57,
    "transcript": "A little cold. Shaking."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1060.37,
    "end": 1063.41,
    "transcript": "Yet, queen-shaven."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1064.07,
    "end": 1065.29,
    "transcript": "It doesn't make any sense."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1069.47,
    "end": 1071.57,
    "transcript": "You've seen this kid in a mask."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1074.83,
    "end": 1079.59,
    "transcript": "And it's been three years since I last said a word about that decision."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1080.05,
    "end": 1090.41,
    "transcript": "What I did, I can never take back."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1094.26,
    "end": 1098.5,
    "transcript": "And learning to live with it, it's just starting to kill me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1100.82,
    "end": 1105.57,
    "transcript": "What have you done that's so horrible?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1105.57,
    "end": 1106.07,
    "transcript": "Nothing."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1358.24,
    "end": 1358.74,
    "transcript": "Hey, dude."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1359.92,
    "end": 1360.42,
    "transcript": "You okay?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1361.2,
    "end": 1362.88,
    "transcript": "I heard you ran out on the doctor."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1367.53,
    "end": 1368.03,
    "transcript": "I need your help."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1368.03,
    "end": 1368.77,
    "transcript": "What is it, bud?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1371.98,
    "end": 1372.88,
    "transcript": "You're starting to worry me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1373.28,
    "end": 1380.82,
    "transcript": "Do you remember, a few years ago, when I thought I was going to lose my job?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1382.16,
    "end": 1383.34,
    "transcript": "Yeah, sure."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1383.5,
    "end": 1388.08,
    "transcript": "You mean when you got the promotion and you met Emily and everything worked out for you?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1388.1,
    "end": 1397.19,
    "transcript": "I did something that wasn't like me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1402.7,
    "end": 1403.74,
    "transcript": "Hey, how are you guys doing?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1404.68,
    "end": 1405.58,
    "transcript": "Can I get you another one?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1407.08,
    "end": 1408.12,
    "transcript": "Maybe later."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1412.29,
    "end": 1413.13,
    "transcript": "What did you do, man?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1413.47,
    "end": 1414.19,
    "transcript": "She in your taxes?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1414.61,
    "end": 1415.81,
    "transcript": "Not my Girl Scout cookies?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1416.13,
    "end": 1417.73,
    "transcript": "I've known you since we were kids."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1419.19,
    "end": 1422.55,
    "transcript": "You know, you're the guy who gets an extra five in change and you take it back."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1422.71,
    "end": 1431.7,
    "transcript": "What I did was unforgivable."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1432.16,
    "end": 1435.82,
    "transcript": "What did you do, man?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1435.94,
    "end": 1436.72,
    "transcript": "You're starting to worry me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1437.2,
    "end": 1437.6,
    "transcript": "Honestly."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1449.88,
    "end": 1451.56,
    "transcript": "How did you know about the doctor's appointment?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1452.28,
    "end": 1452.64,
    "transcript": "Doctor?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1452.78,
    "end": 1453.5,
    "transcript": "Doctor's appointment."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1455.16,
    "end": 1457.44,
    "transcript": "Emily told me she was worried sick about you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1457.44,
    "end": 1459.44,
    "transcript": "But I never told her."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1459.44,
    "end": 1461.44,
    "transcript": "And the doctor couldn't have known?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1462.44,
    "end": 1464.44,
    "transcript": "What the fuck are you talking about, dude?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1464.44,
    "end": 1466.44,
    "transcript": "You really need to calm down."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1466.44,
    "end": 1470.27,
    "transcript": "I need to get the hell out of here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1470.27,
    "end": 1472.27,
    "transcript": "I need to get out of here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1472.27,
    "end": 1474.27,
    "transcript": "Man, no, look, you really have to sit down and talk to me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1474.27,
    "end": 1474.77,
    "transcript": "You shut the fuck up."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1474.77,
    "end": 1476.77,
    "transcript": "Whoa, hey, hey, whoa, whoa."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1476.77,
    "end": 1477.77,
    "transcript": "You want to kill me?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1477.77,
    "end": 1711.03,
    "transcript": "Well, thank you, William."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1711.03,
    "end": 1714.03,
    "transcript": "I've waited three years for you to show me where this money is."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1714.03,
    "end": 1714.53,
    "transcript": "What?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1714.53,
    "end": 1715.53,
    "transcript": "Three goddamn years."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1715.53,
    "end": 1719.53,
    "transcript": "How did you know about the money?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1719.53,
    "end": 1721.53,
    "transcript": "I never told anyone."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1721.53,
    "end": 1726.97,
    "transcript": "Jeff, would you be a doll and go get my money, please?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1726.97,
    "end": 1730.97,
    "transcript": "Once he lowers his firearm, I'll be happy to get our money."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1730.97,
    "end": 1734.97,
    "transcript": "Bill, I don't know where you got the gun, but just put it down before you shoot yourself."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1734.97,
    "end": 1737.97,
    "transcript": "Jeff, what are you doing?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1737.97,
    "end": 1739.97,
    "transcript": "You're like a brother to me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1739.97,
    "end": 1741.97,
    "transcript": "You're right, Bill."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1741.97,
    "end": 1743.97,
    "transcript": "We are like brothers."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1743.97,
    "end": 1745.97,
    "transcript": "We are like brothers."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1745.97,
    "end": 1746.95,
    "transcript": "We are like brothers."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1746.95,
    "end": 1751.95,
    "transcript": "Ever since you moved onto my street from some godforsaken country, I've been there for you and protected you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1751.95,
    "end": 1754.95,
    "transcript": "But that whole time, you got everything."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1754.95,
    "end": 1757.95,
    "transcript": "You always had the women, the money, the fame."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1757.95,
    "end": 1758.95,
    "transcript": "What did I have?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1758.95,
    "end": 1759.95,
    "transcript": "Nothing."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1759.95,
    "end": 1761.95,
    "transcript": "It was always Bill this, Bill that."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1761.95,
    "end": 1762.95,
    "transcript": "Fuck you, Bill."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1762.95,
    "end": 1764.95,
    "transcript": "I never meant to hurt you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1764.95,
    "end": 1766.95,
    "transcript": "And I loved you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1766.95,
    "end": 1768.95,
    "transcript": "Well, I love you too, man."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1768.95,
    "end": 1769.95,
    "transcript": "We're family."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1769.95,
    "end": 1774.95,
    "transcript": "I love you so much, in fact, that I'm going to take your girl and your money and go to some tropical island on a beach"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1774.95,
    "end": 1776.95,
    "transcript": "and drink Mai Tais for the rest of my life."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1776.95,
    "end": 1778.95,
    "transcript": "Not if you don't go get the money."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1778.95,
    "end": 1779.95,
    "transcript": "Now."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1779.95,
    "end": 1780.95,
    "transcript": "Jeff, he's not going to shoot you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1780.95,
    "end": 1781.95,
    "transcript": "Just go get it."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1781.95,
    "end": 1782.95,
    "transcript": "Fuck no."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1782.95,
    "end": 1784.95,
    "transcript": "And by the way, why do you have a gun and I don't?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1784.95,
    "end": 1785.95,
    "transcript": "He has a gun."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1785.95,
    "end": 1786.95,
    "transcript": "You have a gun."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1786.95,
    "end": 1787.95,
    "transcript": "I'm the only one here."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1787.95,
    "end": 1788.95,
    "transcript": "Fuck!"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1788.95,
    "end": 1790.95,
    "transcript": "You killed him!"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1790.95,
    "end": 1795.61,
    "transcript": "No more use to me, anyway."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1795.61,
    "end": 1797.61,
    "transcript": "He wasn't that good in bed, either."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1797.61,
    "end": 1807.41,
    "transcript": "What the hell are you doing?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1807.41,
    "end": 1811.94,
    "transcript": "I know who you are."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1811.94,
    "end": 1817.1,
    "transcript": "I'm sorry I lost you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1817.1,
    "end": 1819.1,
    "transcript": "Who are you talking to?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1819.1,
    "end": 1828.43,
    "transcript": "J'ai tout pardon."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1828.43,
    "end": 1834.58,
    "transcript": "Stop crying, you bitch, and throw me the money."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1834.58,
    "end": 1835.58,
    "transcript": "You..."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1835.58,
    "end": 1837.58,
    "transcript": "You owe me fucking money, yeah?"
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1837.58,
    "end": 1841.78,
    "transcript": "Here it is."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1841.78,
    "end": 1844.54,
    "transcript": "The gun."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1844.54,
    "end": 1845.54,
    "transcript": "Damn."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1845.54,
    "end": 1909.93,
    "transcript": "Well done."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1909.93,
    "end": 1910.93,
    "transcript": "Time has been good to us."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1910.93,
    "end": 1917.93,
    "transcript": "Meeting you, loving you, has been the most amazing experience, and I cherish what we have shared."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1917.93,
    "end": 1920.93,
    "transcript": "It's because of this that I've been so troubled lately."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1920.93,
    "end": 1924.93,
    "transcript": "I feel terrible because I haven't been completely honest with you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1924.93,
    "end": 1928.93,
    "transcript": "There are some things I haven't had the courage to do."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1928.93,
    "end": 1931.93,
    "transcript": "I don't have the courage to tell you about myself."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1931.93,
    "end": 1934.93,
    "transcript": "Even now, I hesitate."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1934.93,
    "end": 1936.93,
    "transcript": "I don't want to share my shame with you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1936.93,
    "end": 1940.93,
    "transcript": "Greed, in all its ugliest facets, seems to fill me at times."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1940.93,
    "end": 1944.93,
    "transcript": "And it drove me to do something that silences me even now."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1944.93,
    "end": 1946.93,
    "transcript": "Drives me into myself."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1946.93,
    "end": 1948.93,
    "transcript": "Into my sickness."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1948.93,
    "end": 1950.93,
    "transcript": "If only you can forgive me."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1950.93,
    "end": 1952.93,
    "transcript": "But no one can forgive what I have done."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1952.93,
    "end": 1954.93,
    "transcript": "What I am doing."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1954.93,
    "end": 1956.93,
    "transcript": "This is almost more than I can bear."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1956.93,
    "end": 1961.93,
    "transcript": "Weak as it is terrible, being was the same one in which I met you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1962.93,
    "end": 1965.93,
    "transcript": "What an ugly fate that they would be entwined together."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1965.93,
    "end": 1969.93,
    "transcript": "But I promise I will right this wrong, even if it means I will lose you."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1969.93,
    "end": 1973.93,
    "transcript": "I love you, and it is because of my love that I must do this."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1974.93,
    "end": 1977.93,
    "transcript": "All my love, William."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1977.93,
    "end": 1987.31,
    "transcript": "Hannah."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1987.31,
    "end": 1989.31,
    "transcript": "It was your gun."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1989.31,
    "end": 1992.31,
    "transcript": "If you leave someone for dead, make sure they're dead."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 1992.31,
    "end": 2015.78,
    "transcript": "Bull taken for everything."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2015.78,
    "end": 2017.78,
    "transcript": "Our biggest job ever."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2017.78,
    "end": 2019.78,
    "transcript": "You're way too far this time, Emily."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2019.78,
    "end": 2020.78,
    "transcript": "You didn't have to kill him."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2020.78,
    "end": 2021.78,
    "transcript": "Oh, come on."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2021.78,
    "end": 2022.78,
    "transcript": "He figured out we were drugging him."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2022.78,
    "end": 2023.78,
    "transcript": "He was going to turn us in."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2023.78,
    "end": 2025.78,
    "transcript": "He had to die."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2025.78,
    "end": 2026.78,
    "transcript": "I'm done."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2026.78,
    "end": 2027.78,
    "transcript": "I'll clean the money."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2027.78,
    "end": 2029.78,
    "transcript": "Then we're done."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2029.78,
    "end": 2030.78,
    "transcript": "Fine."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2030.78,
    "end": 2033.78,
    "transcript": "Clean the damn money and get out."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2034.78,
    "end": 2036.78,
    "transcript": "I'll see you later."
  },
  {
    "video_id": "00036",
    "start": 2036.78,
    "end": 2045.38,
    "transcript": "See you soon."
  }
]